  "content": "<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #000080;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">REPORT on </span>Student Club Inauguration and Technical Talk</span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Department of CSE (Data Science) launched its technical club <em><strong>DataNauts</strong></em> on 14 th May 2025 at AB401, in the presence of Dr. Basavaraj L (Principal), Dr. Anitha D B (Associate Professor &amp; HOD), and Mr. Yogabalaji G, Decision Scientist at Mu Sigma Inc., Bengaluru.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">As part of the launch, a technical talk on <strong>“How Data is used to Build Solutions and Maximizing Efficiency”</strong> was conducted for 4 th and 6 th semester students, coordinated by the staff members of the department and students.</p>\n\n[ngg src=\"galleries\" ids=\"2\" display=\"imagebrowser\"]\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #000080;\">Watch the Video</span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[video width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" mp4=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/WhatsApp-Video-2025-05-19-at-11.01.30-AM-1.mp4\"][/video]</p>\n\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</h5>",
